# Development servers (`vite`, and `vite --mode tauri` for the desktop app)
# read Help from this checkout (public/), so doc edits show at once. Release
# builds keep VITE_DOCS_ORIGIN from .env and read the published docs first.
# To try the published docs in development, set VITE_DOCS_ORIGIN in
# .env.development.local or .env.tauri.local.
VITE_DOCS_ORIGIN=
